# Module: Notifications

## Scope

Notification templates, multi-channel dispatch (MVP: email + in-app), event-driven handlers, user preferences.

## Key Entities

`NotificationTemplate`, `Notification`, `NotificationDelivery`, `NotificationPreference`, `DeviceToken`

## Permissions

```
notifications.template.manage
notifications.broadcast.send
notifications.inbox.read
notifications.preferences.manage
```

## MVP Event Handlers

| Event | Template | Channels |
|---|---|---|
| `AttendanceMarkedIntegrationEvent` (Absent) | `attendance-absent` | email, in-app |
| `FeePaymentReceivedIntegrationEvent` | `fee-payment-confirmation` | email, in-app |
| `GuardianLinkedIntegrationEvent` | `guardian-portal-invite` | email |
| `PasswordResetRequestedIntegrationEvent` | `password-reset` | email |

## Template Placeholders

Use `{StudentName}`, `{ClassName}`, `{Date}`, `{Amount}`, `{ReceiptNumber}`, `{ResetLink}`

## Dispatch Flow

1. Integration event consumed by `NotificationEventHandler`
2. Load template by key + tenant override
3. Render via `TemplateRendererService`
4. Check user `NotificationPreference` (channel opt-out)
5. Queue via `SendNotificationCommand` → background job
6. Record `NotificationDelivery` with status: Pending → Sent → Failed

## Rules

- Never log full email body with PII in production logs
- Failed deliveries retry 3 times with exponential backoff
- In-app notifications: `IsRead` flag, paginated inbox API
- SMS/Push deferred to Phase 2 — stub `INotificationProvider` interface only

## API

- `GET /api/v1/notifications/inbox`
- `PUT /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read`
- `GET /api/v1/notifications/preferences`
- `PUT /api/v1/notifications/preferences`
